  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cons and Rest Broadleaf Forest in Brak Valley, Aux Cornichons IBA - PP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on nearly two years of pilot experience in the broadleaf forest remnants in eastern Haitis Brak Valley, this project will provide incentives to protect reforested and intact forest areas from clearing, grazing and agriculture. It will also create incentives and teach local farmers to grow high-quality nursery stock using native tree species, which local landholders will use to reforest their own parcels. This project aims to restore and increase critical broadleaf forest habitat that supports Bicknells thrush and other neotropical migrant birds, as well as the rich endemic biodiversity of La Visite National Park...</narrative>
  </description>
